# Runtime state of the pinned `dsh` executor — never tracked.
#
# `home/` is the isolated DSH_HOME: 307 MB of node_modules plus session logs, caches and
# an anonymous user id. The credential is passed as an environment variable only and is
# never written here (checked 2026-09-18), but none of this is repository content.
#
# A fresh clone therefore has no runtime, and `tools/harpp2/dispatch-dsh.sh` fails closed
# with exit 4 ("pinned dsh runtime is not installed") rather than silently degrading.
home/
